# Cloudflare Pages cache rules (2026-10-15, the user moved the playtest to Cloudflare: GitHub Pages answered in 0.5 to 34 s
# and kept files 10 minutes). Pages and the first-opening checks are always asked again; everything else a day, so a
# player coming back the next day does not fetch it all again. Scripts and models carry ?v= and change their address.
/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
/
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/intro/
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/intro/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache
